cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "parcel-crop-monitor"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Bakousi
    given-names: Aikaterini
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-10
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/kbakousi/parcel-crop-monitor"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24118763
keywords: [sentinel-2, crop classification, CAP monitoring, parcel, time series]
abstract: >-
  Parcel-level crop and land-use checks with Sentinel-2 time series:
  clear-pixel parcel statistics, gap-aware regular time series, rule-based
  land-use states and harvest/mowing events, out-of-fold Random Forest crop
  verification with spatial-block cross-validation, and traffic-light verdicts.
